          "text": "Bana babo, bena bukitu bakadi binunu bibidi ne nkama muanda mutekete, bakadi ku mutu kua nsubu ya batatuʼabo, bakasungudibua kudi Davidi bua kuikalabo balongolodi ba Bena Lubena ne Bena Gada ne ba tshituha tshia tshisamba tshia Bena Manashe mu malu onso a Nzambi ne a mukelenge kabidi.",
